    {
      "id": "section:3/block:39/seg:0",
      "source": "The second collections of items has been steadily increasing over the years causing clutter in sys.",
      "source_hash": 16542916420371394920,
      "context_hash": 17237136271429302836,
      "translation": "두 번째 항목 모음은 수년에 걸쳐 꾸준히 증가하여 sys를 복잡하게 만들었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:27:01.398867Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:39/seg:1",
      "source": "Guido has even said he doesn't recognize some of things in it [#bug-1522]_!",
      "source_hash": 8765490438354801448,
      "context_hash": 8768727470202624338,
      "translation": "Guido는 심지어 그 안에 있는 일부 항목을 알아보지 못한다고까지 말했습니다 [#bug-1522]_!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:27:01.398867Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:40/seg:0",
      "source": "Moving these items off to another module would send a clear message to other Python implementations about what functions need and need not be implemented.",
      "source_hash": 11689842436239976156,
      "context_hash": 14218215549348771329,
      "translation": "이러한 항목을 다른 모듈로 옮기면 다른 Python 구현에 어떤 함수를 구현해야 하고 어떤 함수를 구현할 필요가 없는지 명확한 메시지를 전달할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:27:01.398868Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:41/seg:0",
      "source": "It has also been proposed that the contents of types module be distributed across the standard library [#types-removal]_; the interpreter module would provide an excellent resting place for internal types like frames and code objects.",
      "source_hash": 9275368496613629234,
      "context_hash": 6698882055891686115,
      "translation": "types 모듈의 내용을 표준 라이브러리 전반에 분산하자는 제안도 있었습니다 [#types-removal]_; 인터프리터 모듈은 프레임과 코드 객체 같은 내부 타입을 보관하기에 매우 적합한 장소가 될 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "standard library": "표준 라이브러리",
        "interpreter": "인터프리터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:27:01.398868Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Specification",
      "source_hash": 12978730460824815227,
      "context_hash": 5194624682862041483,
      "translation": "명세",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:27:01.398869Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A new builtin module named \"interpreter\" (see `Naming`_) will be added.",
      "source_hash": 17598416277810406734,
      "context_hash": 4426697858439326486,
      "translation": "\"인터프리터\"라는 새 내장 모듈이 추가됩니다(`Naming`_\\ 을 참조하십시오).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interpreter": "인터프리터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T20:02:19.925843Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The second list of items above will be split into the stdlib as follows:",
      "source_hash": 11041591932741446571,
      "context_hash": 3369164814358445513,
