    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Transition Plan",
      "source_hash": 15572358788041085597,
      "context_hash": 8426970366232437794,
      "translation": "전환 계획",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:26:14.608193Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Once implemented in 3.x, the interpreter module will be back-ported to 2.6.",
      "source_hash": 12902067715007416121,
      "context_hash": 8179152229381063320,
      "translation": "3.x에서 구현되면 인터프리터 모듈이 2.6으로 역포팅됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interpreter": "인터프리터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:26:14.608194Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Py3k warnings will be added to the sys functions it replaces.",
      "source_hash": 13420912886091986379,
      "context_hash": 10899614526020218015,
      "translation": "이를 대체하는 sys 함수에 Py3k 경고가 추가됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:26:14.608195Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Open Issues",
      "source_hash": 15188361361114285070,
      "context_hash": 3124676355366721556,
      "translation": "미해결 문제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:26:14.608196Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What should move?",
      "source_hash": 5454944365681599670,
      "context_hash": 3594015282055427418,
      "translation": "무엇을 옮겨야 합니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:26:14.608196Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "dont_write_bytecode",
      "source_hash": 18232714037771419203,
      "context_hash": 15721546663918456211,
      "translation": "dont_write_bytecode",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:26:14.608196Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Some believe that the writing of bytecode is an implementation detail and should be moved [#bytecode-issue]_.",
      "source_hash": 14139164183315907636,
      "context_hash": 8146573610791275444,
      "translation": "일부는 바이트코드 작성이 구현 세부 사항이므로 [#bytecode-issue]_ 옮겨야 한다고 생각합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bytecode": "바이트코드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:26:14.608197Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "The counterargument is that all current, complete Python implementations do write some sort of bytecode, so it is valuable to be able to disable it.",
      "source_hash": 7714528122959856785,
      "context_hash": 4718882592008886430,
      "translation": "이에 대한 반론은 현재 완전한 모든 Python 구현이 어떤 형태로든 바이트코드를 작성하므로, 이를 비활성화할 수 있는 것이 가치 있다는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bytecode": "바이트코드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:26:14.608197Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "Also, if it is moved, some wish to put it in the imp module.",
      "source_hash": 11547245867235289414,
      "context_hash": 14964557436040205577,
      "translation": "또한 이를 옮긴다면 일부는 imp 모듈에 넣기를 원합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:26:14.608198Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Move to some to imp?",
      "source_hash": 17018895194265722145,
      "context_hash": 4912780290429661998,
      "translation": "일부를 imp로 옮깁니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:26:14.608198Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "It was noted that dont_write_bytecode or maybe builtin_module_names might fit nicely in the imp module.",
      "source_hash": 2950421842886271955,
      "context_hash": 4354295837621630054,
      "translation": "dont_write_bytecode 또는 어쩌면 builtin_module_names를 imp 모듈에 넣으면 잘 어울릴 수 있다는 의견이 제기되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:26:14.608199Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Naming",
      "source_hash": 2665270351651321507,
      "context_hash": 4401722845036009690,
      "translation": "명명",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:26:14.608199Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The author proposes the name \"interpreter\" for the new module.  \"pyvm\" has also been suggested [#pyvm-name]_.",
      "source_hash": 12911464437302742928,
      "context_hash": 15161077061787705950,
      "translation": "작성자는 새 모듈의 이름으로 \"인터프리터\"를 제안합니다. \"pyvm\"도 제안된 바 있으며 [#pyvm-name]_, \"cpython\"이라는 이름도 좋은 반응을 얻었습니다 [#cpython-name]_.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interpreter": "인터프리터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T20:02:19.925844Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The name \"cpython\" was well liked [#cpython-name]_.",
      "source_hash": 1233994193387571826,
      "context_hash": 8878450132834816764,
      "translation": "\"cpython\"이라는 이름도 좋은 반응을 얻었습니다 [#cpython-name]_.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:26:14.608201Z",
      "issues": []
    },
